        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Rogue, rebuilt for modern play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollows Of Rogue is a traditional turn-based dungeon crawler about surviving long enough to steal the Amulet of Yendor and escape alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Persistent dungeon levels across each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Adjustable difficulty for new players and roguelike veterans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Transparent combat log with events, attack rolls, and defense rolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rebalanced monsters, loot, magic, and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seeded runs for repeatable dungeon generation with more varied layouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No hunger timer, keeping the focus on exploration, risk, and tactical escapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High contrast display option</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enhanced sounds and visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the legacy of the original 1980s Rogue, Hollows Of Rogue adds modern usability and presentation while preserving the core feeling of tactical dungeon exploration, dangerous encounters, scarce resources, and permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiles by Oryx.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Rogue, rebuilt for modern play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollows Of Rogue is a traditional turn-based dungeon crawler about surviving long enough to steal the Amulet of Yendor and escape alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Persistent dungeon levels across each run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Adjustable difficulty for new players and roguelike veterans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Transparent combat log with events, attack rolls, and defense rolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rebalanced monsters, loot, magic, and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seeded runs for repeatable dungeon generation with more varied layouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No hunger timer, keeping the focus on exploration, risk, and tactical escapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High contrast display option</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enhanced sounds and visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the legacy of the original 1980s Rogue, Hollows Of Rogue adds modern usability and presentation while preserving the core feeling of tactical dungeon exploration, dangerous encounters, scarce resources, and permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiles by Oryx.</p>",
